@startuml ssd-us112
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Flight Control\nOperator" as FCO
participant ":AISafe System" as System

activate FCO

FCO -> System : generateMonthlyReport()
activate System
System --> FCO : prompt for year, month, output path
deactivate System

FCO -> System : year, month, outputPath
activate System

note right of System
  Validate year (>= 2000) and month (1-12).
  Collect monthly statistics for the period.
  Render HTML report with Chart.js charts.
  Write report file to outputPath.
end note

System --> FCO : "Report saved to [outputPath]"
deactivate System

@enduml